  "analysis": "The mutant deletes `url.password is None` in `registry_origin` (archive.py:43). The argument is the one for `lock.repository.password`: a value with whitespace is refused at archive.py:39, so a password in the URL means the raw value holds `://`, non-slash non-space characters, `:`, more of them and `@`, which is the third credential shape, refused in the same statement at archive.py:39. test/mutants/shadowed_repository.py: 13,198 seeded origins reach the password test with a password, every one credential-shaped. The oracle has no mutant for any clause of `registry_origin`."
